

## Summary

**Bug**: Demo shots fired in the wrong direction because `fireBullet()` read `player.aimDirX/aimDirZ` (set to `mouseX/-1`) before the "aim at nearest enemy" logic updated them.

**Fix**: Swapped two blocks in the demo branch of the game loop (`index.html`): moved the "aim at nearest enemy" calculation to execute **before** `fireBullet()` is called, so bullets are properly directed at enemies.

**Verification**:
