| 6s | ENEMIES:3 SCORE:0 | ENEMIES:3 SCORE:0 |
| 14s | ENEMIES:3 SCORE:0 | ENEMIES:2 SCORE:100 |
| 34s | ENEMIES:3 SCORE:0 | ENEMIES:1 SCORE:200 |
| 38s | ENEMIES:3 SCORE:0 | ENEMIES:0 SCORE:300 YOU WIN! |

No console errors, game remains fully playable with proper combat rules intact.
